---Loaded only if `render_layer` = "decals". When decoratives are being spawned by [EnemySpawnerPrototype::spawn\_decoration](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/EnemySpawnerPrototype.html%23spawn_decoration#spawn_decoration) or [TurretPrototype::spawn\_decoration](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/TurretPrototype.html%23spawn_decoration#spawn_decoration), decals with `decal_overdraw_priority` greater than 0 will be filtered such that they don't overlap too much. If two or more decals would overlap, only the one with the largest value of `decal_overdraw_priority` is placed.
---
