---Loaded only if `render_layer` = "decals". Value lower than 1 enables masking by water for decals with `tile_layer` greater or equal to [UtilityConstants::capture\_water\_mask\_at\_layer](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/UtilityConstants.html%23capture_water_mask_at_layer#capture_water_mask_at_layer). Water tiles must use water `tile-effect` with [WaterTileEffectParameters::lightmap\_alpha](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/types/WaterTileEffectParameters.html%23lightmap_alpha#lightmap_alpha) set to 0 or value less than 1. Graphics option `Occlude light sprites` must be enabled, as water mask is captured into terrain lightmap alpha channel. Tiles rendered in layer between [UtilityConstants::capture\_water\_mask\_at\_layer](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/UtilityConstants.html%23capture_water_mask_at_layer#capture_water_mask_at_layer) and decal's `tile_layer` will likely also mask decals in some way, as water mask will likely be 0 at their position, but this is considered undefined behavior.
---
---[View Documentation](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/DecorativePrototype.html%23opacity_over_water#opacity_over_water)
---@field opacity_over_water? float
---@
